# Cargo build output and Tauri codegen for this application.
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# The root ignore file excludes *.png as scratch. These four are the tray's
# state icons and this application's own icon — they are compiled into the
# binary with include_bytes! and are release inputs, exactly like
# desktop/src-tauri/icons.
!src-tauri/icons/*.png
